{"data":{"codec":"utf8","content_ref":"inline:The problem 07c99bef33a8 reduces to SRC_005's 'Coherence Path' by claiming that all reliability gains in non-expert panels are simply the result of forcing the agent to traverse a non-trivial logical path; it is refuted if reliability gains persist even when the checklist items are designed as independent binary flags with no logical interdependence.","id":"84a91b7e1a1c5a5da8afe8073e5a791789afd353884b0be3865e11228e8ac433","interface":{"commitments":["hv-floor@2a45b7988522","lineage-ref@eb46ef486177","relation-form@578e42df713e"],"refs":[{"role":"dependence","target":"07c99bef33a8c6f7725794a3355d7ebe701f502b8bae28a9aaf20fbd019ef13d"},{"role":"dependence","target":"1b785818442d3e16d6158e9643a029d21a21ecd3089e602d83a56a0968452b10"},{"role":"dependence","target":"51303b1ea1288ae44c6f3f2fca5ad72a18b26ee0677a8bf9ea15eb60b60e484c"},{"role":"dependence","target":"819524d31cef2a7542f020827fa93286747eb291df240b3138de0e62e9cced6d"},{"role":"dependence","target":"a5e2ba6262315ccb8bab164599d57f8e1f6e126072b0612e309b33f35073c2f2"}]},"provenance":{"event_seq":1448,"role":"conjecturer","school":"school-0"},"warrants":[]},"id":"84a91b7e1a1c5a5da8afe8073e5a791789afd353884b0be3865e11228e8ac433","schema":"artifact"}